{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37158","headline":"贺裴廷裕蜀中登第诗 · 李搏","name":"贺裴廷裕蜀中登第诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜梁千里曙云开，仙籙新从紫府来。\n天上已张新羽翼，世间无复旧尘埃。\n嘉祯果中君平卜，贺喜须斟卓氏杯。\n应笑戎藩刀笔吏，至今泥滓曝鱼鳃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李搏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}